# 9. PHASE 5 — UNIQUE PRODUCT CODE GENERATION

This is one of the most important features.

Factory owners need to generate unique reward codes for physical product packaging.

Admin APIs:

POST /api/codes/generate

GET /api/codes

GET /api/codes/:id

GET /api/codes/batches

GET /api/codes/batches/:id/export

POST /api/codes/:id/block

### Code Generation Requirements

- Use Node.js crypto module.
- Generate unpredictable codes.
- Prevent duplicate codes.
- Use cryptographic randomness.
- Store keyed hashes instead of plaintext.
- Assign codes to products.
- Assign points per code.
- Support batch generation.
- Support expiration dates.
- Track code status.

Batch generation must support:

- 5 codes
- 10 codes
- 25 codes
- 50 codes

Allow larger batches only with appropriate validation and limits.

### Important Physical Packaging Requirement

The factory needs printable plaintext codes to place inside physical product boxes.

Therefore:

- Generate the codes securely.
- Display/export plaintext codes only at generation time.
- Never expose stored code hashes as redeemable codes.
- Protect batch exports with admin authorization.
- Do not allow repeated plaintext retrieval after the initial generation response.

Support CSV export for printing.

